/**
 * src/lib/media/plates.ts
 * ============================================================================
 * Plate source sets (design-system audit 2026-10-22, rec 7 follow-up).
 *
 * Every self-hosted plate ships a JPEG fallback plus WebP/AVIF variants
 * generated by `scripts/generate-image-variants.mjs`. Registries and renderers
 * pass these triples around so <PlateImage> (or any <picture>-capable renderer)
 * can negotiate the modern formats; consumers that only need a URL use
 * `asPlate(x).src`.
 */
